---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import ImageFrame from '../components/ImageFrame.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import { rangitataProducts } from '../data/rangitataProducts';

import hero1Image from '../assets/img/WildBalance_Hero1.jpg';
import hero1LandscapeImage from '../assets/img/WildBalance_Hero1_NarrowLandscape.jpg';
import hero2Image from '../assets/img/WildBalance_Hero2.jpg';
import beechGlassingImage from '../assets/img/lifestyle/WildBalance_AlpineTerrain_BeechGreenHiddenGlassing.jpg';
import summitShotImage from '../assets/img/lifestyle/WildBalance_AlpineTerrain_SummitShot.jpg';
import blackGlassingImage from '../assets/img/lifestyle/WildBalance_AlpineTerrain_BlackGreywackeGlassing1.jpg';
import singerSewingMachineImage from '../assets/img/about/WildBalance_TheProcessOfMakingAHoodie.jpg';

const placeholderImages = {
	hero1: hero1Image.src,
	hero1Landscape: hero1LandscapeImage.src,
	hero2: hero2Image.src,
	beechGlassing: beechGlassingImage.src,
	summitShot: summitShotImage.src,
	blackGlassing: blackGlassingImage.src,
	singerSewingMachine: singerSewingMachineImage.src,
	wool:
		'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550376026-7375b92bb318?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1200',
};

const practicalNotes = [
	{
		title: 'One at a time',
		text: 'This is not standard off-the-shelf clothing with a local logo stitched on. Each garment is individually made by people who know the work.',
	},
	{
		title: 'By hunters, for hunters',
		text: 'The first pieces are aimed at real hunting days: early starts, long climbs, glassing, camp, and cold weather that shifts quickly.',
	},
	{
		title: 'Built on experience',
		text: 'The makers have over 10 years of full-time clothing experience, including running Morphic Ltd from Christchurch.',
	},
];

const hoodieUses = ['Cold mornings', 'Long climbs', 'Glassing', 'Camp', 'Around the fire'];
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Wild Balance | Soft Fibre. Hard Country."
	description="Designed, cut, sewn, and hand dyed merino outdoor clothing from Christchurch, New Zealand."
	image={placeholderImages.hero1}
>
	<Hero
		eyebrow="Not just designed here. Made here."
		title="Soft fibre. Hard country."
		subtitleParagraphs={[
			"The vision: New Zealand-made clothing born from alpine hunting and made with purpose.",
			'Our first release is the Rangitata Merino Hoodie, made to order in Christchurch in men\'s and women\'s styles.',
		]}
		supportParagraphs={[
			'At a time when more and more outdoor clothing is made in offshore factories, we’re offering a point of difference. Get behind the launch of a true kiwi clothing manufacturing brand.',
			'The launch edition features two styles of our Rangitata hoodie: a beech-green/tussock version in block colours, and a greywacke/black version that’s carefully hand-dyed in our studio to create natural variation in tone and pattern.',
			'Limited numbers. Made one at a time to ensure a perfect fit.',
		]}
		imageSrc={placeholderImages.hero1}
		imageMobileSrc={placeholderImages.hero1Landscape}
		imageDesktopSrc={placeholderImages.hero1}
		imageAlt="Placeholder image of a hunter in a hoodie standing in front of a rock wall."
		imageObjectPosition="center"
		primaryHref="/shop"
		primaryLabel="Shop the Launch"
	/>

	<Section
		tone="muted"
		eyebrow="The Launch - The Rangitata Hoodie"
		title="The merino hoodie handcrafted for backcountry adventure."
	>
		<p class="max-w-4xl text-base font-medium leading-7 text-[#3d372d] sm:text-base lg:text-base">
			We are starting with a hoodie because it is the layer us alpine hunters live in.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
			A practical hood for protection from the wind and sun, reduced bulk to stop you getting snagged on the ascent, and a cut that lets you glass without fighting the garment.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
			Doubled-over sleeve and body cuffs add durability where it matters, with no scratchy internal tags you'll experience a high level of comfort and adaptability.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
			We're excited to bring you merino gear shaped by years behind the machines and time in the hills.
		</p>
		<div class="-mx-5 -mb-16 mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:-mx-6 sm:-mb-20 md:mx-0 md:mb-0 md:grid-cols-3">
			<div>
				<ImageFrame
					src={placeholderImages.blackGlassing}
					alt="Wild Balance alpine terrain black and greywacke glassing shot."
					aspect="square"
					objectPosition="center"
				/>
			</div>
			<div>
				<ImageFrame
					src={placeholderImages.summitShot}
					alt="Wild Balance alpine terrain summit shot."
					aspect="square"
					objectPosition="center"
				/>
			</div>
			<div>
				<ImageFrame
					src={placeholderImages.beechGlassing}
					alt="Wild Balance alpine terrain beech green glassing shot."
					aspect="square"
					objectPosition="center"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<section class="border-b border-[#2c271f]/10 bg-[#efe8db] py-14 sm:py-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#626b43]">Limited Edition First Release</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-normal text-[#2c271f] sm:text-4xl">
					The Rangitata Merino Hoodie
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					Two colourways, men’s and women’s styles, made to order in Christchurch.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
				{[
					{
						href: '/shop/rangitata-merino-hoodie-mens-beech-green-tussock',
						product: rangitataProducts.mensBeech,
					},
					{
						href: '/shop/rangitata-merino-hoodie-mens-greywacke-black-shibori',
						product: rangitataProducts.mensGreywacke,
					},
					{
						href: '/shop/rangitata-merino-hoodie-womens-beech-green-tussock',
						product: rangitataProducts.womensBeech,
					},
					{
						href: '/shop/rangitata-merino-hoodie-womens-greywacke-black-shibori',
						product: rangitataProducts.womensGreywacke,
					},
				].map(({ href, product }) => (
					<a href={href} class="group block">
						<div class="space-y-3">
							<ImageFrame
								src={product.galleryImages[0].desktopSrc}
								mobileSrc={product.galleryImages[0].mobileSrc}
								desktopSrc={product.galleryImages[0].desktopSrc}
								alt={product.galleryImages[0].alt}
								aspect="square"
								objectPosition="center top"
							/>
							<div class="space-y-1.5">
								<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#626b43]">
									{product.fitLabel === 'Men’s Fit' ? 'MEN’S MERINO' : 'WOMEN’S MERINO'}
								</p>
								<p class="text-sm leading-6 text-[#625a4d]">
									{product.colourwayLabel}
								</p>
								<p class="text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-[#626b43] underline decoration-[#626b43]/40 underline-offset-4">
									View / Order
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</a>
				))}
			</div>

			<a
				href="/shop"
				class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-[#626b43] underline decoration-[#626b43]/40 underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#4e5631]"
			>
				View the full launch collection →
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Section
		tone="muted"
		eyebrow="FEW AND FAR BETWEEN"
		title="We're not offshoring the hard part."
		intro=""
	>
		<div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-center">
			<div class="space-y-5">
				<p class="text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					A brand that actually makes its clothing here is rare now. A lot of outdoor clothing talks loudly about merino, performance, and New Zealand design, then goes quiet on where the garments are actually made. Wild Balance is taking a different path.
				</p>
				<p class="text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					We have spent years designing, cutting, sewing, and refining garments. We have also spent years hunting, hiking, camping, and learning what clothing needs to do in our turbulent southern weather.
				</p>
				<p class="text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					Wild Balance is where those two worlds meet.
				</p>
				<p class="text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					Before Wild Balance, in pre-earthquake Christchurch we ran <i>Morphic</i>, a cutting-edge clothing business exporting merino hoodies around the world.
				</p>
				<p class="text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					Now, with new patterns refined and a sewing studio rebuilt, we are ready to make something worth backing. Handmade merino hoodies for mountain missions, made one at a time in Christchurch.
				</p>
			</div>

			<ImageFrame
				src={placeholderImages.singerSewingMachine}
				alt="Singer sewing machine used in Wild Balance's history."
				aspect="square"
				objectPosition="center"
				className="-mx-5 -mb-16 sm:-mx-6 sm:-mb-20 lg:mx-0 lg:mb-0"
			/>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<section class="bg-[#efe8db] py-16 sm:py-20">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#626b43]">THE LAUNCH</p>
				<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-normal text-[#2c271f] sm:text-4xl">
					The Rangitata is ready.
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-[#625a4d]">
					Men’s and women’s fits, two colourways, made to order in Christchurch in limited numbers.
				</p>
				<a
					href="/shop"
					class="cta-primary cta-attention mt-8 inline-flex justify-center px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold"
				>
					Shop the Launch
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</BaseLayout>
